        <item>
            <title>2.12.19</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 10:22:37 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/hoomanaskari/mac-dictate-anywhere</link>
            <sparkle:version>61</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.12.19</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Dictate Anywhere 2.12.19

- Fixed unwanted leading spaces and lowercase sentence starts in empty text fields, after image attachments, and on new lines.
- Improved sentence boundaries and capitalization, including the English pronoun “I” and its contractions.
- Update announcements now come to the front and remain accessible in the Dock while open.
- Added a blue dot on the menu-bar icon and an “Update available…” menu item when an update is available.
]]></description>
